land Atlas","/farmland-atlas/missouri/ozark-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Ozark County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February and April to May each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 222% of normal in April to May and 40% in November to December. Grid 19649 had its driest year in 1963 at 57%.</p>"}
